  <p id="c-jinshu-064-simayu-linchuan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-064-simayu-linchuan:p001:m0000" ref="70z_zog_t15">臨川獻王鬱</persName>，字深仁，幼而敏慧。<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simayu-linchuan:p001:m0015" ref="k9q_h4e_j2q">道生</persName>初以無禮失旨，鬱數勸以敬慎之道。<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simayu-linchuan:p001:m0033" ref="k9q_h4e_j2q">道生</persName>不納，鬱為之流涕，<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simayu-linchuan:p001:m0044" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAF">簡文帝</persName>深器異之。年十七而薨。久之，追諡獻世子。甯康初，贈左將軍，加散騎常侍，追封郡王，以<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simayu-linchuan:p001:m0088" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAD">武陵威王</persName>曾孫<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simayu-linchuan:p001:m0094" ref="czx_7wv_kcl">寶</persName>為嗣，追尊其母<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simayu-linchuan:p001:m0102" ref="m1p_h4f_a48">胡淑儀</persName>為臨川太妃。</p>
</text>
